  "markdown": "## Summary\n\nI fixed the flaky test in `store_test.go` and tightened the retry loop.\n\n### What changed\n\n- **Retry loop**: now backs off from 50 ms to 800 ms instead of spinning.\n- **Test**: waits on the `ready` channel rather than sleeping.\n- Removed the unused `legacyMode` flag.\n\n| File | Change | Lines |\n| --- | --- | ---: |\n| `store/retry.go` | backoff | +18 −6 |\n| `store/store_test.go` | wait on channel | +4 −9 |\n\nRun the suite with:\n\n```sh\ngo test ./store/... -count=20\n```\n\nAll 20 runs pass locally. The backoff values follow https://example.com/notes/backoff.\n\nNext steps:\n\n1. Watch CI for a day.\n2. If it stays green, drop `-count` from the [nightly job](https://ci.example.com/jobs/nightly).\n",
